  <cheat desc="Stage 2 title picture: black ground instead of green">
    <comment>Cosmetic. The green area under the boots is the game's own palette data (ROM 4DC30); this paints it black.</comment>
    <script state="on">
      <action>temp0 =maincpu.mw@4DC30</action>
    </script>
    <script state="run">
      <action>maincpu.mw@4DC30=0000</action>
    </script>
    <script state="off">
      <action>maincpu.mw@4DC30=temp0 </action>
    </script>
